</ix:nonNumeric><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2026-01-01to2026-06-30" escape="true" id="Fact000558" name="us-gaap:EarningsPerSharePolicyTextBlock"><p id="xdx_84B_eus-gaap--EarningsPerSharePolicyTextBlock_zyatEqd6alm" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b><i><span id="xdx_860_z99EW5SXVkm6">Basic and Diluted Net Loss per Share</span></i></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Company computes basic net loss per share
by dividing net loss applicable to common stockholders by the weighted-average number of shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock outstanding
during the period. The Company computes diluted net loss per share after giving consideration to the dilutive effect of stock options
that are outstanding during the period, except where such non-participating securities would be anti-dilutive.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

