<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 24.5pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">During each of the three and six months ended
June 30, 2026 and 2025, there was <span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit_do_c20260401__20260630_zwSiunjShMJ8" title="Income tax expense benefit"><span id="xdx_902_eus-gaap--IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit_do_c20260101__20260630_zaXYxacj1xv6" title="Income tax expense benefit"><span id="xdx_901_eus-gaap--IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit_do_c20250401__20250630_z6J12vX8rdda" title="Income tax expense benefit"><span id="xdx_909_eus-gaap--IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit_do_c20250101__20250630_zMe4g2p7nVOi" title="Income tax expense benefit"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit" contextRef="From2026-04-012026-06-30" id="Fact000743" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="0" unitRef="USD"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit" contextRef="From2026-01-01to2026-06-30" id="Fact000745" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="0" unitRef="USD"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit" contextRef="From2025-04-012025-06-30" id="Fact000747" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="0" unitRef="USD"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:IncomeTaxExpenseBenefit" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-06-30" id="Fact000749" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">no</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span></span></span></span> provision for income taxes as the Company incurred losses during both periods. Deferred tax assets
and liabilities reflect the net tax effect of temporary differences between the carrying amount of assets and liabilities for financial
