<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Cash flows used in operating activities for the
six months ended June 30, 2026 totaled approximately $1.4 million, which was primarily due to our net loss for the period, partially offset
